WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:07.460
<b>The Irous encounter during the Holy Tree Festival
was most unexpected.</b>

00:07.830 --> 00:11.080
<b>But thanks to the prompt response
by the Hoshimori Class,</b>

00:11.080 --> 00:13.380
<b>we were able to handle it 
without further commotion.</b>

00:13.380 --> 00:16.130
<b>We have seen no further Irous activity since.</b>

00:16.750 --> 00:20.380
<b>It has been weeks since the last sighting.</b>

00:20.380 --> 00:26.880
<b>But per the request of the Hoshimori Class
we have put the campus under tightened security.</b>

00:28.460 --> 00:33.420
<b>It would seem we were given
an unexpected glimpse at their progress.</b>

00:33.420 --> 00:35.000
<b>Wouldn't you say?</b>

00:36.290 --> 00:37.210
<b>Indeed.</b>

00:38.380 --> 00:42.210
<b>This may very well have been 
a fortunate opportunity.</b>

00:44.880 --> 00:46.170
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

00:45.000 --> 00:46.170
<b>Shinjugamine Girls’ School
Culture Festival
Holy Tree Festival</b>

00:46.170 --> 00:49.250
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

00:49.250 --> 00:54.080
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

00:54.830 --> 00:59.920
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

01:03.880 --> 01:09.920
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora ni 
yume no seiza o mitsukeyou</b>

01:09.920 --> 01:18.330
<b>Kokoro o tsunaidara itsuka kanaeru yo</b>

01:26.630 --> 01:31.580
<b>Hashiridasu junbi wa dekita ka na</b>

01:32.040 --> 01:37.130
<b>Nagai michi demo nakama ga iru kara</b>

01:37.540 --> 01:41.830
<b>Fuange na kao shite mayou yori</b>

01:41.830 --> 01:46.790
<b>Tobikonde waraou</b>

01:47.380 --> 01:52.830
<b>Surechigai de kousa shita heart mo</b>

01:52.830 --> 01:55.540
<b>Kizuna e to kawaru desho</b>

01:55.540 --> 02:02.670
<b>Kasanetara hitotsu ni shite 
mirai o tsukamu chikara ni</b>

02:03.330 --> 02:09.170
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora 
e yume o zutto oikakete</b>

02:09.170 --> 02:14.580
<b>Nobashita tenohira wa 
akiramenai omoi o kureru</b>

02:14.580 --> 02:20.080
<b>Nanbyaku kai no chousen mo 
hitori nanka ja nai kara</b>

02:20.080 --> 02:27.130
<b>Daijoubu kao o agete kitto starry sky</b>

02:27.130 --> 02:29.960
<b>Kanaeru yo</b>

02:32.080 --> 02:37.040
<b>Episode 10
Family</b>

02:39.290 --> 02:40.710
<b>Temporary leave?</b>

02:40.960 --> 02:43.960
<b>Are we being allowed to return home?</b>

02:44.500 --> 02:49.750
<b>After seeing all your hard work our president here
decided you've all earned some time off this retreat.</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:53.630
<b>We haven't seen any noticeable
Irous activity for a while, either.</b>

02:53.830 --> 02:56.500
<b>Go on home and let yourselves 
relax for a bit.</b>

02:56.960 --> 02:59.540
<b>Yipee! When I get home I'm gonna
hang out with my brothers!</b>

02:59.540 --> 03:02.960
<b>It's been a while since I've been home
for anything but a change of clothes.</b>

03:04.080 --> 03:06.750
<b>I gotta hurry and tell my mom and dad!</b>

03:06.920 --> 03:09.380
<b>It's been ever so long since I've been home.</b>

03:09.380 --> 03:13.960
<b>I'm just sure Grandpapa will put together
a grand dinner with a chef and everything.</b>

03:13.960 --> 03:16.540
<b>Do be prepared, Sadone.</b>

03:17.830 --> 03:18.750
<b>Okay!</b>

03:19.170 --> 03:22.080
<b>So this is like a vacation?</b>

03:22.580 --> 03:25.710
<b>Doesn't really make much 
of a difference for me.</b>

03:26.210 --> 03:28.080
<b>Hear, hear.</b>

03:28.790 --> 03:32.880
<b>I hope the flowers in the 
greenhouse are doing well.</b>

03:33.080 --> 03:36.670
<b>I've gotta catch up on 
episodes of Colo Girls!</b>

03:37.290 --> 03:39.630
<b>What are you gonna do, Subaru?</b>

03:39.630 --> 03:41.170
<b>Hmm, yeah.</b>

03:42.210 --> 03:45.790
<b>I guess maybe I'll hang 
with my pops for a change.</b>

03:47.960 --> 03:49.080
<b>Misaki!</b>

03:49.960 --> 03:51.710
<b>Do you wanna come stay at my house?</b>

03:51.710 --> 03:52.540
<b>Huh?</b>

03:52.540 --> 03:58.080
<b>When I texted my mom to tell her I made a new friend
she told me to bring you by sometime.</b>

04:01.170 --> 04:04.920
<b>No, I- This is supposed to be your chance
to be with your family...</b>

04:04.920 --> 04:07.670
<b>It'll only be more fun with you there!</b>

04:08.500 --> 04:10.170
<b>Do you not wanna?</b>

04:10.540 --> 04:12.500
<b>No, it's just...</b>

04:12.500 --> 04:14.630
<b>It's not that I don't want to...</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:17.790
<b>I think...</b>

04:17.790 --> 04:19.170
<b>Hooray!</b>

04:19.460 --> 04:21.630
<b>Okay, I'm gonna let my family know, okay?</b>

04:21.630 --> 04:24.830
<b>My mom's really a great cook, you just wait!</b>

04:25.170 --> 04:27.170
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

04:27.170 --> 04:29.130
<b>Give her my regards...</b>

04:29.130 --> 04:30.210
<b>'kay!</b>

04:33.880 --> 04:35.290
<b>I'm home!</b>

04:36.630 --> 04:38.630
<b>Umm, thanks for having me!</b>

04:40.170 --> 04:41.710
<b>Welcome home!</b>

04:42.920 --> 04:44.670
<b>I'm back, Souffle!</b>

04:44.670 --> 04:48.500
<b>Heh, it's been so long 
I got on the wrong bus.</b>

04:48.500 --> 04:50.170
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

04:50.170 --> 04:55.000
<b>Jeesh, if you're gonna bring a friend
try not to be such a ditz.</b>

04:56.920 --> 05:00.630
<b>Oh yeah, Mom, this is my new classmate
I told you about, Misaki.</b>

05:00.880 --> 05:02.330
<b>Thanks for having me over.</b>

05:02.330 --> 05:05.920
<b>You're very welcome, Misaki. I'm Miki's mom.</b>

05:05.920 --> 05:08.130
<b>But my, oh my aren't you just beautiful.</b>

05:08.130 --> 05:10.420
<b>Just like me when I was young!</b>

05:10.420 --> 05:12.500
<b>Huh? Wha-? Oh, thanks...</b>

05:12.710 --> 05:16.750
<b>Thanks for looking after my sis here. I'm-</b>

05:16.750 --> 05:18.460
<b>Oh, Miku.</b>

05:18.460 --> 05:19.460
<b>Huh?</b>

05:19.750 --> 05:22.500
<b>Wait, did I ever tell you about Miku?</b>

05:23.040 --> 05:26.790
<b>Y-yeah! You mentioned her before, remember?</b>

05:26.790 --> 05:28.250
<b>Did I...?</b>

05:28.250 --> 05:31.330
<b>You didn't tell her anything bad, right?</b>

05:31.330 --> 05:33.330
<b>N-no, probably not...!</b>

05:33.330 --> 05:34.460
<b>Hey...</b>

05:34.460 --> 05:37.000
<b>Okay, okay. Well, come on in, would you?</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:40.830
<b>Misaki, just think of this place
as your home while you're here.</b>

05:43.130 --> 05:44.170
<b>Thanks...</b>

05:47.580 --> 05:49.000
<b>Where's Dad?</b>

05:49.000 --> 05:50.290
<b>He's on a business trip.</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:52.420
<b>He should be home the day after tomorrow.</b>

05:52.420 --> 05:53.460
<b>What?!</b>

05:53.670 --> 05:55.750
<b>It was just so sudden, you know.</b>

05:55.750 --> 06:00.040
<b>When I called to tell him
he basically cried over the phone.</b>

06:01.460 --> 06:04.380
<b>Misaki, any foods you don't like or anything?</b>

06:04.670 --> 06:06.380
<b>No, not in particular.</b>

06:06.380 --> 06:07.790
<b>Wonderful!</b>

06:07.790 --> 06:10.290
<b>Well, what do you say to 
having curry for dinner?</b>

06:10.290 --> 06:11.040
<b>Sure.</b>

06:11.040 --> 06:13.500
<b>Yay! Mom's special curry!</b>

06:13.960 --> 06:17.330
<b>You really do love that 
sweet curry she makes, huh?</b>

06:17.330 --> 06:19.670
<b>Curry is best at its sweetest!</b>

06:19.670 --> 06:22.460
<b>That's just common sense, right?</b>

06:22.460 --> 06:24.580
<b>A spicy curry is no curry at all!</b>

06:24.830 --> 06:26.210
<b>Spicy curry is...!</b>

06:26.210 --> 06:27.170
<b>Huh?</b>

06:27.330 --> 06:28.790
<b>Best, right...?</b>

06:28.790 --> 06:30.000
<b>Yeah, right...</b>

06:31.040 --> 06:34.380
<b>Oh great, now I have two Mikus to deal with.</b>

06:34.380 --> 06:36.000
<b>Oh, no, it's...</b>

06:36.630 --> 06:37.580
<b>Miki!</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:40.130
<b>Would you mind finishing chatting
and coming to help me?</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:43.000
<b>I'll make sure I teach you 
everything you need to know.</b>

06:43.290 --> 06:46.380
<b>What? But I already know how 
to make curry just fine.</b>

06:46.380 --> 06:48.080
<b>"Just fine" huh?</b>

06:48.080 --> 06:50.080
<b>Now, now, come on then.</b>

06:50.080 --> 06:51.290
<b>Fine...</b>

06:51.670 --> 06:55.750
<b>Hmm? Oh no! We don't have any cream?</b>

06:55.750 --> 06:57.130
<b>Cream...?</b>

06:57.130 --> 07:00.080
<b>That's my secret ingredient for sweet curry.</b>

07:00.380 --> 07:02.500
<b>Well, I could go and buy some.</b>

07:02.500 --> 07:05.040
<b>Oh, I couldn't ask that of a guest.</b>

07:05.040 --> 07:07.130
<b>It's fine, I can do at least that much.</b>

07:07.130 --> 07:09.580
<b>Do you know where the supermarket is, though?</b>

07:09.580 --> 07:11.290
<b>It's a bit far.</b>

07:12.000 --> 07:16.080
<b>Why don't I go with you then, Misaki?
I can show you the way!</b>

07:16.080 --> 07:16.830
<b>Huh?</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:20.710
<b>Good idea. Would you mind?</b>

07:21.000 --> 07:22.460
<b>We've got it!</b>

07:24.080 --> 07:25.080
<b>Got it...</b>

07:38.170 --> 07:40.040
<b>It's almost lonely, isn't it?</b>

07:40.040 --> 07:41.080
<b>Huh?</b>

07:41.080 --> 07:42.580
<b>Ms. Yakumo...</b>

07:43.210 --> 07:48.580
<b>Ever since the start of their retreat
it's been almost too lively around here.</b>

07:50.750 --> 07:58.790
<b>But really though, the Hoshimori class should be able
to spend time with their families every day, too.</b>

07:59.170 --> 08:00.540
<b>Yeah...</b>

08:03.830 --> 08:05.040
<b>We're back!</b>

08:05.210 --> 08:06.500
<b>Welcome home!</b>

08:06.500 --> 08:08.750
<b>We've already finished making your curry!</b>

08:09.040 --> 08:13.250
<b>I'm a little worried about how much of a role
you took in making it...</b>

08:13.380 --> 08:18.580
<b>Don't worry! I made sure to check on everything,
so you just eat up.</b>

08:18.580 --> 08:20.130
<b>Why would they be worried?</b>

08:21.420 --> 08:23.790
<b>Huh? Why do you look so relieved?</b>

08:26.210 --> 08:28.210
<b>Okay, sorry for the wait.</b>

08:28.380 --> 08:30.080
<b>Everyone eat up now okay?</b>

08:30.080 --> 08:32.000
<b>Let's eat!</b>

08:32.000 --> 08:33.210
<b>Thanks for making this.</b>

08:37.750 --> 08:42.500
<b>It's so good! Mom's sweet curry is the best!</b>

08:46.750 --> 08:47.880
<b>It's great.</b>

08:47.880 --> 08:51.460
<b>Oh, I'm so happy! Feel free 
to have seconds, okay?</b>

08:51.460 --> 08:53.040
<b>Oh, okay...</b>

08:53.040 --> 08:54.790
<b>Hey! Guess what!</b>

08:55.290 --> 09:02.040
<b>When I introduced Misaki at the store,
the cashier told us we looked like adorable sisters!</b>

09:02.040 --> 09:04.080
<b>Oh, how lovely!</b>

09:04.080 --> 09:09.290
<b>What?! No one ever says 
that when we walk together!</b>

09:09.290 --> 09:10.500
<b>Now, now...</b>

09:10.920 --> 09:17.710
<b>It's strange though. We've only just met
but I already feel like we're one big family.</b>

09:19.040 --> 09:20.250
<b>Family...</b>

09:20.250 --> 09:24.790
<b>Yeah, it's like we've always 
sat down for dinner like this.</b>

09:24.790 --> 09:28.040
<b>Oh, but your poor father isn't even here!</b>

09:29.500 --> 09:32.420
<b>Wait, Misaki! You've already finished?!</b>

09:32.960 --> 09:35.630
<b>Yeah... it was just so good.</b>

09:35.920 --> 09:38.460
<b>Oh my! Did you really like it?</b>

09:38.880 --> 09:40.040
<b>Oh, yes.</b>

09:40.040 --> 09:46.080
<b>The food at school is good, but this has
that real home-style goodness to it.</b>

09:46.380 --> 09:48.710
<b>It's like food for the soul.</b>

09:51.670 --> 09:53.170
<b>Hmm? What's wrong?</b>

09:53.880 --> 09:57.170
<b>I don't think I've ever seen that 
sort of look on your face...</b>

09:58.750 --> 10:01.710
<b>Misaki, want me to go get you some more?</b>

10:01.710 --> 10:03.540
<b>Oh, yes, please!</b>

10:03.540 --> 10:06.290
<b>Why not give some of the sweet curry a try?</b>

10:06.290 --> 10:07.250
<b>Uh...</b>

10:13.250 --> 10:15.330
<b>Oh, that feels great!</b>

10:17.330 --> 10:20.460
<b>Misaki, you and Miki are the same age, right?</b>

10:20.460 --> 10:22.040
<b>Yeah...</b>

10:22.460 --> 10:27.790
<b>I'm so jealous, you seem much more grown up than her,
and like a much better sister.</b>

10:30.830 --> 10:35.880
<b>That sister of mine is just 
the un-girliest of girls.</b>

10:35.880 --> 10:37.380
<b>Girly...?</b>

10:38.420 --> 10:43.630
<b>I feel like it's my duty as her sister
to show her the way, but...!</b>

10:45.170 --> 10:50.960
<b>I know she's busy though, and that
being in Hoshimori is real important and all...</b>

10:52.330 --> 10:57.080
<b>So I guess I just have to 
look out for her as she is.</b>

10:57.500 --> 11:01.630
<b>And maybe it's really not so bad
to have a sister like her, anyway.</b>

11:03.670 --> 11:06.170
<b>You're really fond of her, aren't you?</b>

11:08.130 --> 11:10.000
<b>She is my sister after all.</b>

11:10.000 --> 11:11.420
<b>My one and only.</b>

11:16.290 --> 11:17.880
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:23.330 --> 11:25.580
<b>So there you have it!</b>

11:25.580 --> 11:26.790
<b>G'night!</b>

11:30.040 --> 11:33.460
<b>She's really got a hold of Misaki, huh.</b>

11:33.460 --> 11:34.500
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:34.500 --> 11:36.830
<b>Do you wanna sleep over with me?</b>

11:36.830 --> 11:37.960
<b>What?!</b>

11:45.960 --> 11:48.710
<b>Sorry for being so clingy.</b>

11:48.710 --> 11:50.790
<b>This bed's pretty small, huh.</b>

11:50.790 --> 11:52.000
<b>No...</b>

11:54.210 --> 11:58.960
<b>I wish you were really part of our family...</b>

12:05.670 --> 12:07.750
<b>Family, huh...</b>

12:11.630 --> 12:13.040
<b>Sis...</b>

12:14.420 --> 12:16.330
<b>Understood.</b>

12:16.330 --> 12:17.920
<b>Okay then.</b>

12:19.080 --> 12:22.420
<b>Asuha, I cut up some fruit for you.</b>

12:22.420 --> 12:24.500
<b>I'll be right there, Mother.</b>

12:30.080 --> 12:32.080
<b>The bath's ready!</b>

12:32.080 --> 12:33.420
<b>Coming!</b>

12:33.920 --> 12:36.330
<b>Urara, go to bed already would you?</b>

12:36.330 --> 12:39.460
<b>Okay okay, fine, sheesh...</b>

12:42.500 --> 12:44.290
<b>Take care, then!</b>

12:48.210 --> 12:52.630
<b>Collect 10 stickers and get
a matching plate set!</b>

12:52.830 --> 12:54.040
<b>Oh!</b>

12:54.040 --> 12:56.000
<b>My, oh my, look what we have here!</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.880
<b>I wouldn't imagine you'd be out so late!</b>

12:57.880 --> 13:01.420
<b>I'm just out doing rounds as head of
the school disciplinary committee!</b>

13:01.420 --> 13:04.420
<b>What are you doing out here, Renge?</b>

13:04.420 --> 13:06.750
<b>I just couldn't sleep.</b>

13:07.580 --> 13:10.540
<b>Maybe I should have you walk me home!</b>

13:10.540 --> 13:11.790
<b>Wha-?!</b>

13:25.330 --> 13:26.750
<b>I...</b>

13:27.750 --> 13:30.130
<b>I... What should I...?</b>

13:38.040 --> 13:42.000
<b>Misaki (1st Year HS)
Birthday: November 11th
Sign: Scorpio
Blood Type: O
Measurements: 84/55/86
Height: 159cm
Weight: 45kg
Hobby: Watching comedies
Favorite Way to Relax: Popping bubble wrap
Favorite Food: Curry and rice
Hates: Coffee</b>

13:42.080 --> 13:46.040
<b>Botan Kamine (School President)
Birthday: July 24th
Sign: Leo
Blood Type: A
Measurements: 75/55/76
Height: 144cm
Weight: 36kg
Hobby: Reading
Future Dream: Secret
Ideal Downtime: People watching
Favorite Way to Relax: Simply accepting stress</b>

13:56.130 --> 13:57.830
<b>Misaki...?</b>

14:27.460 --> 14:29.210
<b>Hope...?</b>

14:29.880 --> 14:32.500
<b>What should I do...?</b>

14:32.500 --> 14:33.670
<b>Sis...</b>

14:39.670 --> 14:40.580
<b>You're...!</b>

14:50.420 --> 14:52.830
<b>Today I'm gonna find out what you really are!</b>

15:15.960 --> 15:18.290
<b>If you're really an Irous 
then you're my enemy!</b>

15:24.330 --> 15:26.080
<b>We've got a reading in 
the residential district.</b>

15:26.080 --> 15:28.080
<b>It looks like the same one as last time!</b>

15:28.710 --> 15:30.500
<b>Now it's out in town...?</b>

15:30.500 --> 15:35.130
<b>Get word out to all nearby Hoshimori girls,
and have them move to engage it.</b>

15:35.130 --> 15:36.040
<b>Roger that!</b>

15:37.630 --> 15:40.130
<b>This was hardly a vacation at all...</b>

15:40.830 --> 15:42.830
<b>Her bags are gone and everything.</b>

15:42.830 --> 15:45.380
<b>Do you think she really left?</b>

15:45.380 --> 15:47.500
<b>I wonder if something came up?</b>

15:56.000 --> 15:57.130
<b>Miki?</b>

15:57.130 --> 15:59.130
<b>Hey, is something the matter?</b>

15:59.580 --> 16:02.130
<b>Don't worry! It's nothing major.</b>

16:02.130 --> 16:03.540
<b>Just the same old stuff!</b>

16:04.670 --> 16:06.830
<b>Misaki probably just went on ahead.</b>

16:06.830 --> 16:08.710
<b>I'll go tag along after her, 'kay?</b>

16:08.710 --> 16:09.960
<b>Miki...</b>

16:09.960 --> 16:11.790
<b>We'll both be back soon!</b>

16:12.420 --> 16:16.130
<b>We would never miss out 
on a second day of curry!</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.420
<b>This is where I belong.</b>

16:32.710 --> 16:34.540
<b>Not in some lazy home!</b>

16:50.630 --> 16:51.540
<b>No way...!</b>

16:56.830 --> 16:57.580
<b>Shoot...!</b>

17:05.330 --> 17:06.460
<b>Miki...</b>

17:11.130 --> 17:12.880
<b>Misaki! Are you okay?</b>

17:14.080 --> 17:15.250
<b>Yeah...</b>

17:16.540 --> 17:18.000
<b>How dare you hurt Misaki!</b>

17:18.000 --> 17:20.250
<b>Stand back! This is my battle!</b>

17:20.250 --> 17:21.750
<b>Stay out of this, Miki!</b>

17:22.630 --> 17:23.540
<b>Misaki!</b>

17:27.460 --> 17:28.790
<b>Why you!</b>

17:40.040 --> 17:41.580
<b>Miki! Misaki!</b>

17:45.880 --> 17:47.710
<b>Asuha! Girls!</b>

17:54.080 --> 17:56.960
<b>Hey... that's the same one from the festival!</b>

17:56.960 --> 17:59.960
<b>I guess that means it's after us.</b>

18:00.420 --> 18:02.330
<b>Miki, are you all right?</b>

18:02.330 --> 18:03.830
<b>Yeah, we'll make it!</b>

18:03.830 --> 18:06.000
<b>There's only one enemy! 
Let's surround them and-</b>

18:06.000 --> 18:06.960
<b>No, wait!</b>

18:16.460 --> 18:17.710
<b>What's going on?</b>

18:27.670 --> 18:28.750
<b>There's not just one hood...</b>

18:28.750 --> 18:29.750
<b>There's a ton!</b>

18:29.750 --> 18:32.460
<b>Don't worry! We've got numbers too!</b>

18:32.460 --> 18:35.580
<b>We don't know what they're 
capable of. Let's wait and-</b>

18:35.580 --> 18:37.130
<b>We won't be waiting long!</b>

18:43.420 --> 18:44.920
<b>What power...</b>

18:44.920 --> 18:47.040
<b>They're definitely no normal humans!</b>

18:49.130 --> 18:50.250
<b>Careful!</b>

18:54.380 --> 18:55.880
<b>They're too fast!</b>

18:56.290 --> 18:57.210
<b>Yuri!</b>

19:01.290 --> 19:02.380
<b>Renge!</b>

19:16.040 --> 19:17.210
<b>I knew it...</b>

19:25.630 --> 19:26.630
<b>Why you...!</b>

19:31.580 --> 19:32.920
<b>Misaki!</b>

19:34.130 --> 19:35.250
<b>Why?</b>

19:50.080 --> 19:51.420
<b>Why...?</b>

19:51.830 --> 19:53.790
<b>Why?! We're sisters!</b>

19:56.920 --> 19:58.130
<b>Sisters...?</b>

19:59.460 --> 20:02.830
<b>Misaki, this is your... sister?</b>

20:20.830 --> 20:25.380
<b>Oh, how I could just watch 
you rot away here and now...</b>

20:25.670 --> 20:33.790
<b>But I want you all to fall,
staring into the darkness of despair.</b>

20:34.460 --> 20:38.630
<b>And this is merely the start.</b>

20:53.000 --> 20:54.710
<b>They... ran away?</b>

20:54.710 --> 20:59.000
<b>They didn't run... They let us go...</b>

21:01.170 --> 21:02.460
<b>Why...?</b>

21:03.290 --> 21:06.920
<b>Was that... really your sister, Misaki?</b>

21:10.040 --> 21:13.420
<b>But... her face...</b>

21:14.330 --> 21:15.580
<b>That was...</b>

21:17.380 --> 21:19.540
<b>me... wasn't it?</b>

21:29.330 --> 21:33.920
<b>That was... another version of you...</b>

21:35.830 --> 21:38.250
<b>Misaki, what are you saying?</b>

21:39.630 --> 21:43.500
<b>That other you, she's different.</b>

21:44.670 --> 21:46.710
<b>She's from a different world.</b>

21:52.080 --> 21:55.540
<b>Just like me...</b>

22:12.540 --> 22:19.000
<b>Mawatteru hazu demo tomatteru ki ga shite</b>

22:19.000 --> 22:25.330
<b>Hitori de nayande wakatteru furi</b>

22:25.330 --> 22:31.750
<b>Meimetsu no hate ni tozakaru risou o</b>

22:31.750 --> 22:37.540
<b>Hitomi ni utsushite hashiraseta noise</b>

22:37.540 --> 22:44.080
<b>Kodoku na rondeau ni torawareru ishi</b>

22:44.330 --> 22:47.750
<b>Kazashitara nukedashite</b>

22:47.750 --> 22:53.130
<b>Tomoni kanademashou saa</b>

22:53.250 --> 23:00.080
<b>Dare demo nai kimeru no 
wa jibun jishin dakara</b>

23:00.080 --> 23:06.250
<b>Seikai mo machigai mo "rashisa" ni kawatteku</b>

23:06.250 --> 23:13.040
<b>Kasanariai itsu no hi ka kanau to shinjitara</b>

23:13.040 --> 23:21.880
<b>Shiroi fumen kakidasu kono 
yo ni hitotsu dake no</b>

23:22.130 --> 23:25.130
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:26.710 --> 23:29.500
<b>To think that Misaki is a
Hoshimori member from another world...</b>

23:29.500 --> 23:33.250
<b>So if this were a game,
it'd be like she's from a different timeline?</b>

23:33.250 --> 23:35.500
<b>Just stop. You'll only 
make it more confusing.</b>

23:35.500 --> 23:37.250
<b>Next time: "Truth"!</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next Episode
Truth
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:37.250 --> 23:40.790
<b>Will we have to fight against these
other worldly Hoshimori girls?</b>
